he same time you got him  putting shanks in really good company  along with goldie roger and whitebeard  so high praise high praise back to  marineford though shanks says he's come  to put an end to this war we even see  ben beckmann get some screen time as he  pulls his weapon on admiral kisaru and  tells him not to move during moments  like this it definitely feels like  shanks's commanders like beckman are  stronger than kaidos were considering  how easily another admiral namely  admiral greenbull recently overpowered  them and keep in mind this is all  pre-time skip and chances are like luffy  shanks and his crew could have gotten  stronger after the time skip as well the  marines at marine ford point out how he  had a scuffle with kaido only yesterday  so they are shocked he's already here i  absolutely love how he gives future  yonko buggy d clown the task of  returning luffy's straw hat to him and  even tells buggy he has a treasure map  for him as akainu mentions is shanks  that allows luffy to escape so he's not  only strong enough to ruin the plans of  kaido but also to ruin the plans of the  marines buggy is furious when he finds  out that shanks didn't actually have a  treasure map and then he expresses his  frustration to the yonko as if they were  still just fellow apprentices buggy's  followers are blown away by his attitude  toward one of the yonko and just gain  more respect for buggy mihawk just  leaves when shank shows up saying he  never agreed to fight him i love that  detail i think it's him not wanting to  go back on his previous view of fighting  a one-armed shanks but also more  importantly because he doesn't want to  fight his friend to help submarines  again shank says that he doesn't want to  fight it would only lead to more loss of  life on both sides but if anyone still  wants to fight the red hair pirates are  down he even calls out blackbeard  specifically asking him if he wants to  fight but blackbeard passes saying it's  not yet his time to fight shanks this  matchup when it finally comes will be  epic but clearly even blackbeard isn't  confident in being able to beat shanks  at this point even with the strongest  paramecia fruit now in his control  shanks told everyone to retreat and even  said he'll take whitebeard and aces  bodies so the government can't make  spectacles of their deaths even though  the government would obviously want the  bodies to illustrate their power fleet  admiral sengoku gives in to shanks's  command shanks's presence and the  presence of his commanders alone was  enough to end the war which was also  called the greatest battle of the great  pirate age later we see marco thank  shanks at whitebeard and ace's graves  for making it possible for them to get  proper burials at this point shanks  contemplates how hard ace's death must  be for luffy and thinks to himself you  grow up and become a man by experiencing  victory and defeat by doing difficult  things and shedding tears it's all right  to cry just overcome it then we enter a  bit of a shanks winter where we don't  really get anything until a cover story  for chapter 838 where we see shanks  reading the news of luffy's new 500  million bounty after dressrosa and  smiling after whole cake island we again  see shanks reacting to luffy's new  bounty of 1.5 billion and his new title  of the fifth emperor he smiles  commenting that it looks like they'll be  meeting soon thus the implication is  that unlike a marine ford luffy is now  very close to fulfilling their promise  of meeting again when he becomes a great  pirate on a side note after defeating  kaido and gaining a 3 billion berry  bounty and becoming a yonko it's  definitely about time for 19 year old  luffy to meet 39 year old shanks who has  the highest known active bounty right  now at  4.0489 billion berries since kaido and  big mom's bounty became inactive after  their defeats so shang split the heavens  with the strongest man in the world he  exchanged legendary blows with the  strongest swordsman in the world he made  the strongest creature in the world  change his route and he stopped the  greatest war because no one not the  strongest marines nor the strong pirates  present wanted to mess with him by the  time chapter 907 came around you'd think  that shanks could no longer surprise us  but he does in a big way he gets an  audience with the five elders and  marijua not only do they not chase this  yonko out of the capital of the world  government they arranged time to meet  with him at shanks's request that's the  kind of sway this dude has he can meet  with the five elders the highest world  government rulers aside from imu in the  world government's capital we know he  came to talk about a certain pirate but  we never learned who that pirate was at  first everyone thought it was blackbeard  since he went to whitebeard to talk  about him then when luffy was revealed  to be the sun god nika people speculated  shanks might have been warning them  about luffy and his fruit mostly the  evil shanks theorists thought it was the  latter but if shanks knew luffy would  have to die to awaken the fruit that is  possible no matter how unlikely that he  told them so that they could ensure  luffy awakens the fruit then most  recently after the reveal that buggy is  now a new yonko people are speculating  that he could have been talking about  buggy setting him up as a potential  yonko candidate for the five elders new  theories will continue to spring up as  new developments take place in the story  but just the fact that you can get an  audience with the highest powers that be  in their safest of places as a pirate is  insane it could be because as they  revealed before he's not one to cause  trouble and arguably because of his  peacemaking role they might see a lot of  value in cooperating with him however  there's also speculation that he could  be a celestial dragon and that's why the  five elders would meet with him even  though he's a yonko leave your thoughts  for why you think shanks can talk to the  five elders when he wishes to in the  comments either way he's clearly  confident enough in his powers if he's  willing to walk into enemy territory  alone like that it might even be a bit  of a smoker not chasing dragon situation  where they know they can't get him even  if they tried so they don't try another  hype detail we learned during chapter  928 is that kid who now has a bounty  equal to luffy's of 3 billion lost his  arm in a battle with the red hair  pirates now we don't really know if this  was shanks ben beckman or someone else  who took his arm but it goes to show how  epic shanks and his crew are even saying  he lost an arm to them raises his street  cred a lot as we look back we can see  why shanks is such a hyped character  he's introduced as a guy who lets people  walk all over him but turns out to be  arguably the strongest living character  in one piece and is currently the one  with the highest known active bounty and  yet he led a dude who bragged about  having an 8 million barry bounty make  fun of him because he wanted to avoid  unnecessary bloodshed oda has made it so  that every one of the few times shanks  is shown or mentioned it's in a very  hyped way it's come to the point where  oda could just show him in a panel doing  nothing in a new chapter and we'd go  crazy over it although i think people  underestimate mihawk's level i would say  based on the newest developments that  shanks is probably the strongest pirate  in one piece at the moment although  blackbeard and luffy are fast  approaching and it's definitely  reasonable to argue that luffy could be  stronger since he did beat the strongest  creature in the world and the guy people  bet on in a one-on-one fight but like i  explained the fact that we haven't seen  what shanks is capable of yet even  though we know he was able to clash with  kaido and get his way he was able to  stop the greatest war and he was able to  walk into the holy land during the  reverie without fear it all points to  him being a more powerful force than the  already defeated kaido and big mom since  i want this to be a pretty comprehensive  video about shanks let's also address  the character's obvious connection to  the norse god tier and what that  parallel can tell us about shanks's  likely future tyr was concerned with the  formalities of war like treaties and  justice clearly paralleling shanks's own  role as peacekeeper in the story in one  case tyr placed his hand between the  jaws of the monstrous wolf fenrir so the  other gods could trap him when the other  gods tricked fenrir the wolf bit off  tyr's arm this sacrifice is why tyr is  identified as a one-handed god just like  shanks is the one-handed yonko who  sacrificed his arm to a sea king in  order to protect luffy they are both  represented as brave figures ready to  make real sacrifices for their own  ideals tyr's fate during ragnarok was to  slay and be slain by the wolf garmer who  is called the greatest monster garmer  has also been connected to the greek  mythological dog cerberus before  cerberus is often portrayed as a  three-headed dog which may make you  think of shanks's greatest enemy in one  piece blackbeard the yonko with three  skulls on his pirate flag the final  battle between shanks and blackbeard has  long been foreshadowed and built up  shanks fears blackbeard more than any  other as he warned whitebeard and only  the scars blackbeard gave him still her  shanks even at marineford blackbeard  said it's not yet the time for them to  fight but that in and of itself implies  that there will be a time for them to  fight down the line i do believe that  shanks will eventually fall to  blackbeard whether he's killed like tyr  was or is simply defeated remains to be  seen but then luffy will come in to  finally finish off his greatest rival  blackbeard perhaps like with tyr and  garmur shanks will in some way help set  the foundation for blackbeard's defeat  at luffy's hands and as in the myth both  will help take each other down in the  end and luffy and buggy will be left to  rule as the pirate kings let me know  your thoughts on all this and is there  anyone out there who still doesn't think  that blackbeard will fight and defeat  shanks i'd honestly be pretty surprised  if that doesn't happen in one way or  another oda could even make it so that  blackbeard cheats in some way and  defeats shanks without necessarily  proving he's stronger than him that  would after all be a very blackbeard  thing to do anyways smash that like  button if you appreciate this long video  it's like the only video i can remember  that i divided the recording between two  different days so definitely smash that  like button if you enjoyed this vid on  one of the most hyped characters in one  piece the character who went from being  bullied by a petty mountain bandit to  becoming the most wanted man in the  world if i did miss any more details  drop them down below in the comments so  we can all check it out join the nakamot  by subscribing and hitting that  notification bell to turn on all  notifications or you will miss future  one-piece videos and updates now is not  the time you want to be missing one  piece because real soon as shanks  himself said he'll have his reunion with  luffy unless blackbeard gets in the way  first if you're a real one and stay  tuned to this all the way to the end  then i really appreciate you and drop a  hashtag all hail buggy in the comments  or at the end of your comment just let  me know you watch until the end again i  really appreciate it this was probably  my second longest video ever and while  you wait for the next video to drop feel  free to check out my huge and growing  one piece playlist that includes videos  in all the yonko warlords supernova and  more link to that is in the description  and on screen right now and until next  time see ya space cowboys
 

